Source: liblccv
Priority: optional
Maintainer: special-delivery <development@special-delivery.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, libopencv-dev, libcamera-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Section: libs

Package: liblccv
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: LCCV (libcamera bindings for OpenCV) (runtime)
 LCCV (libcamera bindings for OpenCV) is a small wrapper library that provides access to the Raspberry Pi camera in OpenCV.
 This package provides the shared libraries.

Package: liblccv-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: liblccv (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: LCCV (libcamera bindings for OpenCV) (development)
 LCCV (libcamera bindings for OpenCV) is a small wrapper library that provides access to the Raspberry Pi camera in OpenCV.
 This package provides the development headers and cmake config files.

Package: liblccv-doc
Architecture: all
Section: doc
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: LCCV (libcamera bindings for OpenCV) (documentation)
 LCCV (libcamera bindings for OpenCV) is a small wrapper library that provides access to the Raspberry Pi camera in OpenCV.
 This package provides the documentation.
